  "decisions": [
    "Dedicated block adds original specialized rows before inherited basic/standalone rows; registered item avoids duplicating them, including plain BlockItem CokeOven registration.",
    "Distillation overrides sided text with energy only, six structural descriptions replace invented item/fluid face rows; cheap overclocking already used by native large machine engine.",
