    "TU CokeOven omits energy-input text, keeps original item/fluid face rows, ignition,16 parallel and conditional tool hints.",
    "Source LogisticsCore four white and six yellow description rows, green energy heading and unit color; inherited builder/magnifier/wrench once.",
    "Original17999 fixed-upward controller receives full default source chain; unsupported HBM provider row omitted because port has no such adapter.",
    "Add only source17997 positive REV components and its original aMachine wrench/material-quality metadata; no arbitrary circuit tag ingredient or whole multiblock hull total."
  ],
